# LFP & Spike Analysis Pipeline

This repository contains the analysis pipeline for in vivo LFP and spike recordings from freely moving mice during optogenetic stimulation of the serotonergic system. Three tools were used: ChR2, vSWO-5HT1B, and vLWO-5HT1A.

