## Dependencies

Install all required packages into your Python environment:

```bash
pip install numpy scipy matplotlib pandas specparam tdt
```

Or with conda:

```bash
conda install numpy scipy matplotlib pandas
pip install specparam tdt
```

Tested with Python 3.11, NumPy 2.2, SciPy 1.13, specparam 1.0+.

> **Note:** The `tdt` package requires a Tucker-Davis Technologies system license for data loading. All other pipeline steps run without TDT access.

