## Notebooks

`LFP_Pipeline_Example_Notebook.ipynb` and `Spike_Pipeline_Example_Notebook.ipynb` provide a step-by-step walkthrough of the complete LFP or spike pipeline using a **synthetically generated example dataset**.

> The example datasets are synthetically generated by Claude (Anthropic) for illustrative purposes. It is not derived from real recordings. The synthetic signals are designed to mimic the statistical properties of real dCA1 LFP data but do not represent actual experimental observations.

To run the notebook:

```bash
conda activate tdt
jupyter notebook notebooks/LFP_Pipeline_Example_Notebook.ipynb
```

