## Key analysis parameters

| Parameter | Value | Script |
|-----------|-------|--------|
| Raw sampling rate | 24 kHz | — |
| LFP lowpass cutoff | 100 Hz (FIR) | `preprocessing_lfp.py` |
| LFP target sampling rate | 1000 Hz | `preprocessing_lfp.py` |
| Spike bandpass | 300–6000 Hz (Butterworth order 4) | `preprocessing_spikes.py` |
| Spike threshold | 5× MAD | `preprocessing_spikes.py` |
| Welch segment length | 2 s (0.5 Hz resolution) | `process_lfp_psd.py` |
| NLMS step size (µ) | 0.015 | `process_lfp_psd.py` |
| Bootstrap iterations | 5000 | `process_lfp_psd.py` |
| Cohen's d thresholds | small=0.2, medium=0.5, large=0.8 | `process_lfp_psd.py` |
| FOOOF frequency range | 1–100 Hz | `process_lfp_fooof.py` |
| FOOOF aperiodic mode | knee | `process_lfp_fooof.py` |
| Adjusted baseline window | 120 s | all scripts |
| Adjusted stimulation window | 300 s | all scripts |
